Z||000000||Jake||01-21-2001||05:19 AM||||I noticed alot of you guys were talkin about racing games like NFS and Grand tourismo. has anyone played I'76? It's actually and Auto combat game...but you can take the guns and crap like that off and just race. It's really fun because you can do almost anything to your car. There are tons to choose from. Hemi Cudas, camaros, chevelles, chargers, old coupes, vettes, mustangs, and alot more. you can dowload bigger motors, suspensions, brakes, tires, paintjobs, lowered cars, lifted trucks, New places to drive. Just a whole bunch of stuff and it was really cool cause you could play it over the internet with other people and race them. the coolest place to do it was the Air base cause you could use the Airplane runway. You could just drive around and chat at the same time. Last time I heard they were having problems with the servers for the net tho. It was really popular for a long time. Did anyone ever play it and know if you can still play it on the net? ||||reg||1
